# virsh snapshot-dumpxml

> Print snapshot XML.
> More information: <https://manned.org/virsh>.

- Print the XML of a snapshot:

`sudo virsh snapshot-dumpxml "{{vm_name}}" "{{snapshot_name}}"`

- Display help:

`virsh snapshot-dumpxml --help`
